{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_03_end",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_03",
  "title": "7:22P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-3",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6b1244c971ab20a2b00175932ff9e2179714cc3b043fbbea2c4cd6795d1895fd",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Phew... It's getting late. Time to go home and sleep..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is a great place to run a seafood stand. I can't believe how many customers came through. Hm? Is that...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll break this arm if I have to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's me, it's me! Let go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? What are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I just closed up. I'm on my way home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're the one who's here spacing out—— Well, I guess it's not spacing out if you can flip around and snap my neck like that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you hear that car accident just now, up on the overpass?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...aren't you supposed to be studying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "One must strike a balance between recreation and labor. If I spent the whole night before the exam cramming, I'd go in there with my brain totally fried."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah, sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I heard some customers talking about it. I hope nobody died."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Same... but I heard something at the office. I guess there's some real unsavory characters mixed up in this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's get this out of the way: I have nothing to do with any killers, gangs, or anyone in that world. You know that, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everybody knows your deal—— Or maybe I should just say, with this attitude of yours, it's natural to be a little suspicious?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...right. I get it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And there was a gas explosion on a highway in the outskirts just two hours ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A gas explosion on a highway? That's a pretty convenient explanation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, you're not thinking...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I told you: one must strike a balance between recreation and labor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...right. I get it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So is this recreation or labor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There we go. They can't do anything downtown like this. Too many people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You ordered the matcha, right? This one's yours. My treat."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't see any mafia-looking guys, but... aren't we letting our guard down a bit too much?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you talking about? This place is a FIVE STAR recommendation. That's way more awesome than some mobsters."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You been able to contact Texas and them yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, it was so fast..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So what's to be all nervous about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your ice cream's melting. You gotta calm down already."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Er, it's just... nobody could have predicted this. I should calm down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "These mobsters came aaall the way from Siracusa to Lungmen. We can bet they're not here for Sauin, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...They definitely have some other goal. One of them is me, but beyond that, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're in a good position. We managed to lose them. And with just the two of us versus however many of them, we have the advantage in scouting them out..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But how do we proceed? Should we start hunting them? No, the better move is to reconnect with Texas..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh. You seem a lot more like an ordinary Messenger than Texas and the girls."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, sorry, was I talking to myself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, you're right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We know the mob is up to something, we can't just go off half cocked."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But sometimes you gotta trust in the girls. I know they can be a little out there, but Penguin Logistics is a tough cookie."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's kind of weird to call a logistics firm 'tough,' but... Forget it. It's not like I've got any room to complain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's just take a walk, enjoy the scenery. And maybe by the time we run into Texas and the crew, they'll have this whole gang war all wrapped up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...erm, really?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mostima?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You see that candy store?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's really more of a stall than a store."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm, it is pretty old."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I came here on a trip to Lungmen years ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Back then... I didn't have any Lungmen dollars on me. Honestly, I must've looked a sight. But still, I found myself drawn to the candy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "O... kay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's what a Messenger does. We get into trouble on our long and arduous journeys."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "C'mon, let's take a look."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Girl",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wow! It's a twinkly star!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Girl",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mister, how did you pull a star down here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sorry, but that's a secret I'll have to keep."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Boy",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's not a star! It's just a candy with some food coloring!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Girl",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I've never seen such a pretty candy before... you sure you don't want one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Boy",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Y- you're such a pain! Don't they have any cotton candy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course we do. Here, give me your hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Girl",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh... but I don't want cotton candy. I want that one..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Boy",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I hate fruity candies! They're too sweet! And they turn your tongue weird colors!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just take what you want. No charge. For Sauin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now it's getting late. You kids hurry home and get to bed!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Girl",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thanks, mister!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Boy",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hurry up! I wanna go to the toy store and check out the limited Sauin knights they got!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Kids these days have so much energy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you want something? We've got these lovely Victorian gumdrops. Real imports. And they come with a candle for Sauin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're in no hurry. The night is young."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ho ho. And so are you. You two must be here for the downtown Carnival."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Mostima, who is this guy...?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...you enjoy the nightlife, sir?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not with these old bones I don't. But the candy I sell tends to make its way there for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is there something special about this year's Carnival Gala? Looks like a lot of foreign guests in town."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Things have been quiet in this town for too many years. The people are definitely itching for the Carnival."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Carnival brings in all kinds of characters showing up getting into all kinds of trouble. And that's pretty fun, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah, for sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The point of Sauin was always to see off the souls of the departed. If the living are having a good time, that's a decent sacrifice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You really don't want anything? Last time, you stood outside with your face stuck to the display window. I thought I was gonna have to peel you off."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wow, you remember me? That's kind of embarrassing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hah. How could I forget?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'd love to. But I really can't be eating too many sweets before work."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's too bad... Ah well, have a good evening, kids."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do come again, when you have time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah. Of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Carnival, huh? I heard it's the biggest festival event for Lungmen in years."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......Bison?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sorry, I just had something on my mind..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's pretty obvious what you'd be thinking about at a time like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But boy do you love thinking too much. Just go with your gut sometimes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My gut... even a Messenger like you says to trust your gut?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You play it case by case. Like right now we're up here on a bridge, and there's a cargo ship passing down below us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And we got three disguised mobsters coming at us from both directions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wha!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's too late now. They've been watching us for a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Since the candy store."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We- we're surrounded?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's tourists all around us, so we can't fight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I'm not sure these guys have any hangups about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...so what do we do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Jump."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sorry?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Jump. Now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Off the bridge——?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There you go with that thinking again. Hop over the railing. Take a leap of faith. Like so——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W- wait a sec——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Welp! Somehow I feel like this isn't my first time in freefall...."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's... candy? Why is this freighter hauling candy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But at least it looks like we lost them, Mostima——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mostima?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
